ue="5432" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#707070;fontColor=#404040;labelBackgroundColor=default;fontSize=11;exitX=0.5000;exitY=1.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5000;entryY=0.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="rl" target="pg"><mxGeometry x="0.0000" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e14" value="5432" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#707070;fontColor=#404040;labelBackgroundColor=default;fontSize=11;exitX=0.5000;exitY=0.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5000;entryY=1.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;startArrow=block;startFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="pr" target="pg"><mxGeometry x="0.0000" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e15" value="files, ACL" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#707070;fontColor=#404040;labelBackgroundColor=default;fontSize=11;exitX=0.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=1.0000;entryY=0.8942;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="pk" target="mq"><mxGeometry x="0.0000" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n16" value="One Compose file for both published configurations: reference (two engines) and minimal (one engine); Valkey, relay and the projector always run. Reference settings: .env.example, section for the reference machine. Behind an operator&#x27;s own reverse proxy, compose.behind-proxy.yml makes the gateway speak plain HTTP on 127.0.0.1. Moving to a new host: scripts/export.sh and scripts/import.sh. Scaling is manual; Kubernetes manifests and autoscaling are not part of this edition. No component except the engine has a standby: broker, Valkey and Postgres are single. Stated capacity, measured 16–17.11.2026 (test environment on another host, devices admitted by mTLS, registry bound): 5 000 devices with 3 200 charging sessions at once; the whole fleet reconnects within 61 s. One engine is allowed and not measured separately.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Key.&lt;/b&gt; Grey: outside the server (dashed border: test only); white: a runtime node (container). Solid line: request or message in normal work; dashed: one-time setup or test only; two arrowheads: both ways." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="760" width="2240" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
